  </div>
  <div class="faq-item">
    <h3>What causes roof algae in humid climates like Florida?</h3>
    <p>Algae on roofs in Florida is often caused by the warm and humid climate, which provides an ideal environment for algae spores to thrive and spread.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-item">
